---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---
<MainLayout title="Local Tools | AInothing" description="Privacy-first utilities designed to run in your browser.">
  <section class="tools shell">
    <p class="overline" data-reveal>Local tools / Building now</p>
    <h1 data-reveal>Your files.<br /><em>Your machine.</em></h1>
    <div class="intro" data-reveal><p>Small AIGC utilities designed to run in the browser. No account, no upload, and no pretending every task needs a server.</p><span>First releases are in development.</span></div>
    <div class="tool-list">
      <a href="/tools/3d-face-lab" data-reveal><span>01</span><h2>3D Face Lab</h2><p>Shape an adult female GNM head locally and translate its structure and expression into a GPT Image 2 prompt.</p><b>Open beta ↗</b></a>
      <article data-reveal><span>02</span><h2>Image Optimizer</h2><p>Resize, compress, convert, and remove metadata locally.</p><b>Planned</b></article>
      <article data-reveal><span>03</span><h2>Text Chunker</h2><p>Clean and split long documents for model context windows.</p><b>Planned</b></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
<style>
  .tools{padding:clamp(4rem,8vw,8rem) 0 clamp(5rem,10vw,9rem)}h1{margin:2rem 0;font-size:clamp(5rem,14vw,12rem);line-height:.75}h1 em{color:var(--secondary);font-weight:500}.intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:2rem;margin-left:32%;padding:2rem 0 5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--foreground)}.intro p{max-width:40rem;color:var(--muted-text);font-size:1.1rem}.intro span{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.64rem;text-transform:uppercase}.tool-list{border-top:1px solid var(--foreground)}article,.tool-list>a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:60px .8fr 1fr auto;gap:2rem;align-items:center;min-height:150px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}article>span,article b,.tool-list>a>span,.tool-list>a b{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.64rem;text-transform:uppercase}.tool-list>a{color:var(--foreground)}.tool-list>a:hover{padding-inline:1rem;background:#e8e9ff}.tool-list p{margin:0;color:var(--muted-text)}.tool-list b{color:var(--signal-dark)}@media(max-width:700px){.intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-left:0}.tool-list article,.tool-list>a{grid-template-columns:30px 1fr;padding:1.5rem 0}.tool-list article p,.tool-list article b,.tool-list>a p,.tool-list>a b{grid-column:2}}
</style>
